msgid "As usual, I should have listened to my wife. She is way more lucid than I am. Every week I complained to her \"It's not good enough, we should grow faster, what am I missing?\" and she used to reply: \"But you already are the fastest growing company in Belgium!\" (Deloitte awarded us as"
